      <pattern name="sibling-handler-shape" location="src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane/Handlers/KvSecretsPopulation/">Task 047 H4 — reuse IIdempotencyService pattern, Cosmos run store pattern.</pattern>
